<title>JAPAN: Horipro seen listing on Tokyo bourse on March 10.</title>
<headline>Horipro seen listing on Tokyo bourse on March 10.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Friday that entertainment firm Horipro Inc has applied to list its shares on the second section of the bourse.</p>
<p>Trading of the shares is expected to start on March 10.</p>
<p>The company will issue 250,000 shares in a public offering, and the subscription period will be conducted over two days during the week of February 18-25, it said.</p>
